<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Komag Inc.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Komag Inc.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist cut its rating on Komag to HOLD from Buy following company's announcement Monday that Q4 EPS and gross margins will fall below Q3 levels.</p>
<p>-- Reduced Q4 EPS estimates to $0.17/shr from $0.54 and cut 1997 estimate to $2.10/shr from $3.10/shr, noting difficulties may carry over into first half of 1997.</p>
<p>-- Komag down 5-5/8 to 27-1/2.</p>
</text>
